# Version 8.2.0:

* Updated AdaCL.Trace for better wide-string support
* Added a new line-insert filter to AdaCL.SAR that can insert multiple lines and/or only at the first matched location
* AdaCL.Serial now generates the macOS serial communication layer on the fly

